<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] items-center">
    <div class="reveal panel-gradient-strong rounded-3xl border border-border p-8" data-reveal="left">
      <p
        class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-muted-foreground"
        data-i18n="privacy.tag"
      >
        Security & Privacy
      </p>
      <h3 class="font-display mt-4 text-3xl text-foreground" data-i18n="privacy.title">
        Your data never leaves the vault.
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground" data-i18n="privacy.description">
        Sanctum stores everything locally using SQLCipher and keeps session access timeboxed. Backups
        stay encrypted, and nothing syncs unless you explicitly export or import it.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-4">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground" data-i18n="privacy.cards.encryption.title">
            Vault Encryption
          </p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-i18n="privacy.cards.encryption.description">
            AES-256-GCM via SQLCipher.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-4">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground" data-i18n="privacy.cards.session.title">
            Session Lock
          </p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-i18n="privacy.cards.session.description">
            Auto-lock after inactivity.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-4">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground" data-i18n="privacy.cards.backups.title">
            Encrypted Backups
          </p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-i18n="privacy.cards.backups.description">
            Export and restore safely.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-4">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground" data-i18n="privacy.cards.telemetry.title">
            No Telemetry
          </p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-i18n="privacy.cards.telemetry.description">
            No analytics or trackers.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal space-y-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground" data-reveal="right">
      <p data-i18n="privacy.notes.import">
        Every import is best-effort. Bad rows are reported, good rows still land in your ledger, and
        duplicates are skipped to keep the vault clean.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="privacy.notes.crypto">
        Crypto price sync uses CoinGecko and can be routed through a proxy for extra privacy. If you
        prefer zero network calls, leave auto-fetch off and operate entirely offline.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="privacy.notes.settings">
        Settings allow you to choose English or Spanish, set a preferred currency (USD/CLP), and
        maintain a workflow that matches your reality.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
